**** Todo:
     feat(discounts/cart): Rename and fix Discounts collection; unify cart logic and psql schema
     Removed the old “coupons” collection and replaced it with a single “discounts” collection, merging coupon & discount features into one.
     Cleaned up PostgreSQL tables (dropped leftover coupons references, fixed naming conflicts with discounts and join tables).
     Ensured columns were camelCase in the discounts table (e.g., discountPercentage), removing discount_percentage references.
     Added an endpoint /next/get-active-discounts (and logic) to fetch automatic/bulk discounts,
     separate from /next/apply-discount for manual coupons.
     Updated cart calculation to handle direct item.price (fallback to priceJSON if absent), ensuring nonzero totals and discount amounts.
     Set hasMany = false on Orders discount field to avoid needing an orders_rels table.
     Fixed prettier formatting issues and reorganized the Cart Context code for readability.

